 id="arm" class="badge">—</span></div><b>Auto</b><div><span id="auto" class="badge">—</span></div><b>Cycle</b><div id="cycle">0</div></div><div class="sep"></div><div class="row"><button id="armBtn" class="ok">ARM</button><button id="disarmBtn" class="warn">DISARM</button><button id="autoBtn" class="ok">AUTO ON</button><button id="killBtn" class="warn">KILL-SWITCH</button></div><div class="small" style="opacity:.8;margin-top:8px">KILL=ON bloque toute exécution. AUTO propose max 1 pending par cycle.</div></div><div class="card"><h3>Policy (JSON)</h3><div class="small" style="opacity:.8">ALLOW_ALL_IF_EMPTY=0. Allowlist obligatoire (pairs[]).</div><textarea id="policyText"></textarea><div class="row"><button id="savePolicy" class="ok">Sauver Policy</button><button id="resetPolicy" class="warn">Reset</button></div></div></aside><main><h2>Console</h2><div class="card"><h3>Statut</h3><div class="kv"><b>Pending</b><div id="pendingLine" style="opacity:.8">—</div><b>Dernière tx</b><div id="lastSig" style="opacity:.8">—</div><b>Usage</b><div id="usageLine" style="opacity:.8">—</div></div><div class="sep"></div><div class="row"><button id="proposeNow">PROPOSER (1)</button><button id="clearPending" class="warn">CLEAR PENDING</button><button id="retryConfirm">RETRY CONFIRM</button></div></div><div class="card"><h3>Proposition</h3><div id="prop" class="log"></div><div class="sep"></div><div class="row"><button id="approve" class="ok">APPROUVER & SIGNER</button><button id="reject" class="warn">REJETER</button></div></div><div class="card"><h3>Audit</h3><div id="audit" class="log"></div></div></main></div><script>(function(){function addScript(src,cb){var s=document.createElement("script");s.src=src;s.async=false;s.onload=function(){cb(null)};s.onerror=function(){cb(new Error("loadfail:"+src))};document.head.appendChild(s);}addScript("/aiaquila/vendor/solana-web3.iife.min.js",function(e){if(e){document.body.innerHTML="<pre style='color:#fff;padding:16px'>ERR vendor solana-web3.js m